```plantuml
@startuml MultiDatasetAPI_Sequence

actor "API User" as user
participant "Client App" as client
participant "API Gateway" as gateway
participant "Request Router" as router
participant "Dataset Service" as service
participant "Dataset 1" as dataset1
participant "Dataset 2" as dataset2
participant "Data Fusion Engine" as fusionEngine
participant "Result Aggregator" as aggregator

autonumber "<b>Multi-Dataset API Interaction"

== User Initiates Request ==
user -> client : Sends request parameters
client -> gateway : POST /multi-dataset-query\n{parameters}

== API Gateway Processing ==
gateway -> router : Forward request
router -> service : Query multiple datasets\n{query}
service -> fusionEngine : Merge criteria\n{parameters}

== Parallel Dataset Queries ==
alt Dataset 1 available
    fusionEngine -> dataset1 : Fetch data\n{query subset}
    dataset1 --> fusionEngine : Returns dataset1 data\n{response}
else Dataset 1 unavailable
    fusionEngine -> dataset1 : Skip (fallback handled)
end

alt Dataset 2 available
    fusionEngine -> dataset2 : Fetch data\n{query subset}
    dataset2 --> fusionEngine : Returns dataset2 data\n{response}
else Dataset 2 unavailable
    fusionEngine -> dataset2 : Skip (fallback handled)
end

== Data Fusion & Aggregation ==
fusionEngine -> aggregator : Consolidate results\n{combined data}
aggregator -> aggregator : Validate schema/completeness
aggregator --> fusionEngine : Processed results\n{enriched data}

== Response Delivery ==
fusionEngine --> service : Combined response\n{processed data}
service --> router : Formatted results\n{API response}
router --> gateway : Final payload
gateway --> client : 200 OK\n{response}

@enduml
```

