@startuml
participant Patron as "Patron"
participant Repository as "Repository"

note right of Patron
  requests previous name(s) and publication date range
end note

Patron->>Repository: getPreviousReportVersions
alt Has previous versions
  Repository-->>Patron: {
    previousNames = ["Name1", "Name2"]
    publicationDateRange = {2020-01-01, 2022-12-31}
  }
else
